<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <title>Rapport de suivi DiabTrack</title>

    <style>
        @page {
            margin: 28px 32px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
            font-size: 10px;
            line-height: 1.45;
            color: #243B53;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, p {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .header {
            background: #102A43;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 22px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .brand {
            font-size: 23px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .brand span {
            color: #2DD4BF;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #D9E2EC;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .period {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding-top: 10px;
            border-top: 1px solid #486581;
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-top: 18px;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: #102A43;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #14B8A6;
            padding-bottom: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .info-table,
        .summary-table,
        .data-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .info-table td {
            width: 50%;
            padding: 5px 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E6EEF5;
        }

        .label {
            color: #627D98;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .summary-table {
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .summary-table td {
            width: 25%;
            padding: 10px 6px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #D9E2EC;
        }

        .summary-value {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #102A43;
        }

        .summary-label {
            margin-top: 3px;
            font-size: 8px;
            color: #627D98;
        }

        .data-table th {
            background: #EAF7F5;
            color: #102A43;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 7px 6px;
            font-size: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #D9E2EC;
        }

        .data-table td {
            padding: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #E6EEF5;
            vertical-align: top;
            font-size: 8px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 3px 6px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 7px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .badge-low {
            background: #E8F1FF;
            color: #1D4ED8;
        }

        .badge-ok {
            background: #E8F8F2;
            color: #047857;
        }

        .badge-high {
            background: #FDECEC;
            color: #B91C1C;
        }

        .notice {
            margin-top: 18px;
            padding: 11px 13px;
            background: #FFF5F5;
            border: 1px solid #EF4444;
            color: #7F1D1D;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .notice-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .empty {
            color: #829AB1;
            font-style: italic;
            padding: 8px 0;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 8px;
            border-top: 1px solid #D9E2EC;
            text-align: center;
            color: #829AB1;
            font-size: 7px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    {# EN-TÊTE #}
    <div class="header">

        <div class="brand">
            Diab<span>Track</span>
        </div>

        <div class="subtitle">
            Rapport de suivi
        </div>

        <div class="period">
            Période du
            <strong>{{ startDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</strong>
            au
            <strong>{{ endDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</strong>
        </div>

    </div>


    {# PATIENT #}
    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">
            Informations du patient
        </div>

        <table class="info-table">
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <span class="label">Nom :</span>
                    {{ user.name ?: 'Non renseigné' }}
                </td>

                <td>
                    <span class="label">Prénom :</span>
                    {{ user.firstname ?: 'Non renseigné' }}
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>
                    <span class="label">Date de naissance :</span>

                    {% if user.dateOfBirth %}
                        {{ user.dateOfBirth|date('d/m/Y') }}
                    {% else %}
                        Non renseignée
                    {% endif %}
                </td>

                <td>
                    <span class="label">E-mail :</span>
                    {{ user.email ?: 'Non renseigné' }}
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>
                    <span class="label">Poids :</span>

                    {% if user.weight %}
                        {{ user.weight }} kg
                    {% else %}
                        Non renseigné
                    {% endif %}
                </td>

                <td>
                    <span class="label">Rapport généré le :</span>
                    {{ "now"|date('d/m/Y') }}
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

    </div>


    {# OBJECTIFS #}
    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">
            Objectifs glycémiques personnels
        </div>

        {% if glycemicTarget %}

            <table class="info-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <span class="label">À jeun / avant repas :</span>
                        {{ glycemicTarget.fastingMin|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }}
                        –
                        {{ glycemicTarget.fastingMax|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }}
                        g/L
                    </td>

                    <td>
                        <span class="label">Après repas :</span>
                        {{ glycemicTarget.postMealMin|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }}
                        –
                        {{ glycemicTarget.postMealMax|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }}
                        g/L
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <span class="label">Au coucher :</span>
                        {{ glycemicTarget.bedtimeMin|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }}
                        –
                        {{ glycemicTarget.bedtimeMax|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }}
                        g/L
                    </td>

                    <td>
                        Plages personnelles enregistrées dans DiabTrack.
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

        {% else %}

            <div class="empty">
                Aucun objectif glycémique personnel enregistré.
            </div>

        {% endif %}

    </div>


    {# SYNTHÈSE GLYCÉMIQUE #}
    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">
            Synthèse glycémique
        </div>

        <table class="summary-table">
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ bloodSugarCount }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        MESURES
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {% if bloodSugarAverage is not null %}
                            {{ bloodSugarAverage|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }}
                        {% else %}
                            —
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        MOYENNE G/L
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ inTarget }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        DANS L'OBJECTIF
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ belowTarget + aboveTarget }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        HORS OBJECTIF
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <table class="summary-table">
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ belowTarget }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        SOUS L'OBJECTIF
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ aboveTarget }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        AU-DESSUS DE L'OBJECTIF
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ meals|length }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        REPAS
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ activities|length }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        ACTIVITÉS
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

    </div>


    {# HISTORIQUE GLYCÉMIE #}
    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">
            Historique des glycémies
        </div>

        {% if bloodSugars is not empty %}

            <table class="data-table">

                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Date</th>
                        <th>Heure</th>
                        <th>Valeur</th>
                        <th>Contexte</th>
                        <th>Position / objectif</th>
                        <th>Note</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>

                <tbody>

                    {% for bloodSugar in bloodSugars %}

                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                {{ bloodSugar.date|date('d/m/Y') }}
                            </td>

                            <td>
                                {% if bloodSugar.time %}
                                    {{ bloodSugar.time|date('H:i') }}
                                {% else %}
                                    —
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>

                            <td>
                                <strong>
                                    {{ bloodSugar.value|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} g/L
                                </strong>
                            </td>

                            <td>
                                {{ bloodSugar.context ?: 'Non renseigné' }}
                            </td>

                            <td>

                                {% if bloodSugar.relation == 'hypoglycemie' %}

                                    <span class="badge badge-low">
                                        Sous l'objectif
                                    </span>

                                {% elseif bloodSugar.relation == 'hyperglycemie' %}

                                    <span class="badge badge-high">
                                        Au-dessus de l'objectif
                                    </span>

                                {% elseif bloodSugar.relation == 'normale' %}

                                    <span class="badge badge-ok">
                                        Dans l'objectif
                                    </span>

                                {% else %}

                                    —

                                {% endif %}

                            </td>

                            <td>
                                {{ bloodSugar.note ?: '—' }}
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                    {% endfor %}

                </tbody>

            </table>

        {% else %}

            <div class="empty">
                Aucune mesure de glycémie sur cette période.
            </div>

        {% endif %}

    </div>


    {# HBA1C #}
    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">
            HbA1c
        </div>

        {% if latestHba1c %}

            <p>
                Dernière valeur enregistrée sur la période :
                <strong>
                    {{ latestHba1c.value|number_format(1, ',', ' ') }} %
                </strong>
                le
                {{ latestHba1c.date|date('d/m/Y') }}.
            </p>

        {% else %}

            <div class="empty">
                Aucune mesure d'HbA1c sur cette période.
            </div>

        {% endif %}

    </div>


    {# INSULINE #}
    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">
            Suivi de l'insuline
        </div>

        <table class="summary-table">
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ insulines|length }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        INJECTIONS
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ totalInsulinDose|number_format(1, ',', ' ') }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        UNITÉS ENREGISTRÉES
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

    </div>


    {# NUTRITION #}
    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">
            Nutrition
        </div>

        <table class="summary-table">
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ meals|length }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        REPAS ENREGISTRÉS
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ totalMealCalories }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        KCAL ENREGISTRÉES
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

    </div>


    {# ACTIVITÉ #}
    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">
            Activité physique
        </div>

        <table class="summary-table">
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ activities|length }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        ACTIVITÉS
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ totalActivityDuration }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        MINUTES
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <div class="summary-value">
                        {{ totalActivityCalories }}
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-label">
                        KCAL
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

    </div>


    {# AVERTISSEMENT #}
    <div class="notice">

        <div class="notice-title">
            Important — interprétation du rapport
        </div>

        Les classifications des glycémies présentées dans ce document
        reposent sur le contexte enregistré pour chaque mesure et sur les
        objectifs personnels configurés dans DiabTrack.

        Ce rapport est un document de suivi. Il ne constitue pas, à lui seul,
        un diagnostic médical et ne remplace pas l'avis d'un professionnel
        de santé.

    </div>


    <div class="footer">
        DiabTrack — Rapport de suivi généré automatiquement le
        {{ "now"|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}
    </div>

</body>
</html>